{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a70656fed330316b0b91b5884b400cbf","RawContent":"I messaged my friend&#039;s agent and she gave me a bunch of prices from $1200 - $1500.  Your resort was on the list!  I have my research cut out for me now.  Tripadvisor and I are going to get a work out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886614,"PostDate":1424202420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I messaged my friend's agent and she gave me a bunch of prices from $1200 - $1500.  Your resort was on the list!  I have my research cut out for me now.  Tripadvisor and I are going to get a work out.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77be7f7bb2e1ee80e57823c4bd572e6c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Neako\" post=\"1886614\" timestamp=\"1424202420\"]\nI messaged my friend&#039;s agent and she gave me a bunch of prices from $1200 - $1500.  Your resort was on the list!  I have my research cut out for me now.  Tripadvisor and I are going to get a work out.[\/quote]Ohhhh nice.  Share the list - I love knowing :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886616,"PostDate":1424202479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Neako, on 17 February 2015 - 11:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I messaged my friend's agent and she gave me a bunch of prices from $1200 - $1500.  Your resort was on the list!  I have my research cut out for me now.  Tripadvisor and I are going to get a work out.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOhhhh nice.  Share the list - I love knowing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84e18bff939c8038805a08cafeefd9c4","RawContent":"\n\nJamaica\n\n\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p\n\n\nMayan Riviera\n\n\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nDominican Republic\n\n\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes\n\n\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes\n\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes","Attachments":[],"Id":1886617,"PostDate":1424202741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br>\nJamaica<br><br>\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p<br><br>\nMayan Riviera<br><br>\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDominican Republic<br><br>\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes<br>\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6091f46f2904d2f0c8cdfef015aefbae","RawContent":"Wow those are all fantastic. I wasn&#039;t getting prices like that when we booked :) now you have lots to consider!!!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886618,"PostDate":1424203217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow those are all fantastic. I wasn't getting prices like that when we booked <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> now you have lots to consider!!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01f6e0a405fe993f1ce454e8402ffa18","RawContent":"Sorry Cablelove, we totally crashed your thread.   I haven&#039;t totally given up on Hard Rock but I&#039;m working on a new plan.  Which is stay,  and get married at Riu Palace Mexico and have any budget conscious guests stay at one of the neighbouring Rius.  If that works.   That&#039;s my current area of investigation.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886660,"PostDate":1424225322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sorry Cablelove, we totally crashed your thread.   I haven't totally given up on Hard Rock but I'm working on a new plan.  Which is stay,  and get married at Riu Palace Mexico and have any budget conscious guests stay at one of the neighbouring Rius.  If that works.   That's my current area of investigation.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f094e583fbf7fe1e0247a2cf3728480f","RawContent":"I am really wanting the HR too we were quoted $3000\/ per person 7 days! Oiy I&#039;d have no guests lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1889336,"PostDate":1426462698,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am really wanting the HR too we were quoted $3000\/ per person 7 days! Oiy I'd have no guests lol \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426459823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8eefdaacae584f904325caa81097820c","RawContent":"We considered Beach Palace, which is pretty similar to HR, but it was too expensive, even for traveling in August they were quoting us $1800 plus taxes  :unsure:\n[quote name=\"JoannaBanana\" post=\"1886617\" timestamp=\"1424202741\"]\nJamaica\n\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes\n\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p\n\nMayan Riviera\n\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes\n\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes\n\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes\n\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes\n\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes\n\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes\n\nDominican Republic\n\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes\n\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes\n\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes[\/quote]those are some great quotes! Especially including taxes. \n\nI have to say Punta Cana has the best beaches, never been to Jamaica, but between Mexico and DR. That&#039;s something to consider too :). I was at Majestic Colonial a few years back (right next to and sister resort to Elegance) and it was a pretty nice resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889388,"PostDate":1426510617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We considered Beach Palace, which is pretty similar to HR, but it was too expensive, even for traveling in August they were quoting us $1800 plus taxes\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoannaBanana, on 17 February 2015 - 11:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Jamaica<br><br>\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p<br><br>\nMayan Riviera<br><br>\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDominican Republic<br><br>\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes<br>\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>those are some great quotes! Especially including taxes.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have to say Punta Cana has the best beaches, never been to Jamaica, but between Mexico and DR. That's something to consider too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I was at Majestic Colonial a few years back (right next to and sister resort to Elegance) and it was a pretty nice resort.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f1acd4b65f7567b222f21da41845ea8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Every time I post in this thread I feel like a gate crasher.&amp;nbsp; So I&#039;ll mention that my quote for Hard Rock was $2000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] I stayed at the Majestic Colonial as well, it was great.&amp;nbsp; My friend was married there, small party - 13.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t want to copycat though.&amp;nbsp; Those quotes are all for September 2015 however, and we&#039;re not ready to move that fast.&amp;nbsp; We want our guests&amp;nbsp; to have time to save and plan.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889471,"PostDate":1426536766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Every time I post in this thread I feel like a gate crasher.\u00a0 So I'll mention that my quote for Hard Rock was $2000.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> I stayed at the Majestic Colonial as well, it was great.\u00a0 My friend was married there, small party - 13.\u00a0 I don't want to copycat though.\u00a0 Those quotes are all for September 2015 however, and we're not ready to move that fast.\u00a0 We want our guests\u00a0 to have time to save and plan.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56fa7d919b69f2eeaf56d98d3a492ed9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JoannaBanana\" post=\"1886617\" timestamp=\"1424202741\"]\nJamaica\n\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes\n\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p\n\nMayan Riviera\n\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes\n\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes\n\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes\n\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes\n\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes\n\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes\n\nDominican Republic\n\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes\n\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes\n\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes[\/quote]Where are you flying from with these prices? These are amazing prices I&#039;d like to know more and how myself can get these prices! Nothing I&#039;ve been quoted so far has been under $2000 per person per week.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889537,"PostDate":1426556569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoannaBanana, on 17 February 2015 - 11:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Jamaica<br><br>\nGrand Bahia Principe - approx $1363 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nAny of the Rius in Jamaica are quoting over $1600 p\/p<br><br>\nMayan Riviera<br><br>\nRiu Tequila - approx $1347 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Playaca r- approx $1437 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nRiu Yucatan - approx $1467 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nNow Sapphire - $1476 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Riviera Princess - $1366 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nGrand Sirenis Maya - $1216 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDominican Republic<br><br>\nRiu Bambu in Punta Cana - approx $1500 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nDreams Palm Punta Cana - approx $1258 p\/p including taxes<br><br>\nCatalonia Royal Bavaro - approx $1248 p\/p including taxes<br>\nMajestic Elegance - approx $1458 p\/p including taxes<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Where are you flying from with these prices? These are amazing prices I'd like to know more and how myself can get these prices! Nothing I've been quoted so far has been under $2000 per person per week.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426459823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":n