ts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Riu Palace<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Royalton Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Secrets Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Valentin Imperial Maya<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Zoetry Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00a0Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.\u00a0 Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.\u00a0 Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.\u00a0 Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).\u00a0 Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.\u00a0 Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.\u00a0 Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.\u00a0 Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.230.226.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c635dd362e2fa859eedf05958d7acef8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have an amazing opportunity for anyone getting married at HR Punta Cana between April 10-16th! I am a professional wedding and lifestyle photographer coming to shoot a conference at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed &lt;strong&gt;complimentary!&lt;\/strong&gt; Please reach out to me for details.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.RipeResolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;melissa@riperesolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope we can connect!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kindest,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Melissa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892080,"PostDate":1428367627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have an amazing opportunity for anyone getting married at HR Punta Cana between April 10-16th! I am a professional wedding and lifestyle photographer coming to shoot a conference at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed <strong>complimentary!<\/strong> Please reach out to me for details.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.RipeResolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>melissa@riperesolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope we can connect!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kindest,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Melissa<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mlssadsouza@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.118.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391531640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"riperesolution","Id":276496,"Name":"riperesolution","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.156.178.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a56ebf0a3f0554d5ddc0a161f4723b0f","RawContent":"Hi everyone, \n\n\nI will be a November 2016 HRPC bride, anyone else getting married there around that time? I would love to exchange any details or information regarding the wedding planning process etc. At this point we have paid our deposit and sent a few emails back and for with our Miami wedding planner (Christina Hernandez). I&#039;m waiting for guests to rsvp and put their deposits down (by Nov 17th). I&#039;m finding all the wedding add-Ons (decorations and vendors) pretty expensive and the hotel doesn&#039;t let you bring your own decorations. Any of you previous HRPC brides have any tips on how to keep costs low?","Attachments":[],"Id":1906073,"PostDate":1444347956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, <br><br>\nI will be a November 2016 HRPC bride, anyone else getting married there around that time? I would love to exchange any details or information regarding the wedding planning process etc. At this point we have paid our deposit and sent a few emails back and for with our Miami wedding planner (Christina Hernandez). I'm waiting for guests to rsvp and put their deposits down (by Nov 17th). I'm finding all the wedding add-Ons (decorations and vendors) pretty expensive and the hotel doesn't let you bring your own decorations. Any of you previous HRPC brides have any tips on how to keep costs low?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna_f86@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.156.178.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439988101,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JFan","Id":284482,"Name":"JFan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"134.192.250.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3eb950c1d84719e1ea8111201b96627","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married there in December 2016... I went through a travel agent. The prices were:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For 2 people, air, hotel, and transportation to and from the airport...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3 nights: 2665&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4 nights: 3051&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5 nights: 3324&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7 nights: 4095&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906721,"PostDate":1445531435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married there in December 2016... I went through a travel agent. The prices were:<\/p>\n<p>For 2 people, air, hotel, and transportation to and from the airport...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3 nights: 2665<\/p>\n<p>4 nights: 3051<\/p>\n<p>5 nights: 3324<\/p>\n<p>7 nights: 4095<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"warfy01@msn.com","IpAddress":"71.179.247.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444945546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285098.jpg?_r=1447074651","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KateWarf","Id":285098,"Name":"KateWarf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4291792609ad268d513eefaed2452f50","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KateWarf\" post=\"1906721\" timestamp=\"1445531435\"]\nI am getting married there in December 2016... I went through a travel agent. The prices were:\nFor 2 people, air, hotel, and transportation to and from the airport...\n\n3 nights: 2665\n4 nights: 3051\n5 nights: 3324\n7 nights: 4095[\/quote]Wow !!! Where are you flying from?!  Little shocked at their prices. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906724,"PostDate":1445538624,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KateWarf, on 22 October 2015 - 08:30 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am getting married there in December 2016... I went through a travel agent. The prices were:<br>\nFor 2 people, air, hotel, and transportation to and from the airport...<br><br>\n3 nights: 2665<br>\n4 nights: 3051<br>\n5 nights: 3324<br>\n7 nights: 4095<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow !!! Where are you flying from?!  Little shocked at their prices. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.156.178.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a4ec724aa0c69bc16416d15110232c7","RawContent":"We are coming from Vancouver, Canada and the prices are even a little more than what KateWarf posted. It&#039;s $2500 per person for 7 nights. I asked a bunch of my guests before I booked and everyone loved the resort and seemed to be ok with the price being a little more than other places. I just hope the resort is worth it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906726,"PostDate":1445543725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are coming from Vancouver, Canada and the prices are even a little more than what KateWarf posted. It's $2500 per person for 7 nights. I asked a bunch of my guests before I booked and everyone loved the resort and seemed to be ok with the price being a little more than other places. I just hope the resort is worth it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna_f86@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.156.178.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439988101,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JFan","Id":284482,"Name":"JFan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1445548546,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7d20b184c7135cf4fe344fbafea19aa","RawContent":"I&#039;m in Calgary so was just a bit surprised.  I know a couple who&#039;s gone there and loved it. They have a good reputation :) and I bet it&#039;s a fun place to be.  The dollar isn&#039;t helping pricing either! \n\n\nOhhhhh I missed the two person part. I thought it was $4000 per person so that&#039;s why I almost fell off my chair. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906728,"PostDate":1445548504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm in Calgary so was just a bit surprised.  I know a couple who's gone there and loved it. They have a good reputation <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and I bet it's a fun place to be.  The dollar isn't helping pricing either! <br><br>\nOhhhhh I missed the two person part. I thought it was $4000 per person so that's why I almost fell off my chair. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.160.226.92","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78772,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8002faee5fa09f1ce7e75deedb342dd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;JFAN, I&#039;m a Nov 2016 bride there as well. Have you joined the facebook group for Palace Resort and Hard Rock Brides? If not please do. It&#039;s amazing with so much help and details. I actually found the d\u00e9cor and their vendor prices to be reasonable compared to a lot of resorts. We actually switched from a Sandals resorts for this reason. My ceremony set up would&#039;ve been $3000 at Sandals vs. $1000 using an HRPC vendor.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908732,"PostDate":1451323048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>JFAN, I'm a Nov 2016 bride there as well. Have you joined the facebook group for Palace Resort and Hard Rock Brides? If not please do. It's amazing with so much help and details. I actually found the d\u00e9cor and their vendor prices to be reasonable compared to a lot of resorts. We actually switched from a Sandals resorts for this reason. My ceremony set up would've been $3000 at Sandals vs. $1000 using an HRPC vendor.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittnek@gmail.com","IpAddress":"144.160.226.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435089813,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bkelly8","Id":283657,"Name":"bkelly8","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
