. If i were to purchase the ones you have i would need about 30 to match&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899850,"PostDate":1436194324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276354\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276354-has31\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">has31<\/span><\/a> i would love to speak to you about the fans. If i were to purchase the ones you have i would need about 30 to match<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.163.54.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79345,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11c3a9fcbf34c731a11b57f25f14999d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"] Unfortunately I am not finding the same exact fans anymore. I bought them on ebay and it doesn&#039;t look like the seller has anymore. It would be cute to do half and half ( a different color perhaps). I bought 20 fans because at the time, I thought that would be plenty for my small wedding. Several more people RSVPed and we had about 32 people total. &amp;nbsp;Only one fan was used. So glad I chose not to rent parasols a few days before. I think everyone had gotten used to the heat by the time the wedding rolled around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899895,"PostDate":1436242032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> Unfortunately I am not finding the same exact fans anymore. I bought them on ebay and it doesn't look like the seller has anymore. It would be cute to do half and half ( a different color perhaps). I bought 20 fans because at the time, I thought that would be plenty for my small wedding. Several more people RSVPed and we had about 32 people total. \u00a0Only one fan was used. So glad I chose not to rent parasols a few days before. I think everyone had gotten used to the heat by the time the wedding rolled around.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"halishields31@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.151.250.251","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390848884,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.p