s so we ended up postponing the wedding for a few years. &amp;nbsp;I ended up gaining wait and no longer fit into this dress, otherwise I would have been thrilled to wear it. &amp;nbsp;Pictures don&#039;t do it justice. &amp;nbsp;It is white with silver appliqu\u00e9 and beading. &amp;nbsp;Very simple A-line strapless dress with the petty coat to go underneath. &amp;nbsp;I paid over $700 and I am selling this for $399 OBO. &amp;nbsp;This really is a gorgeous dress and I wish I was able to wear it. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901040,"PostDate":1437676502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got this dress when we started wedding planning the first time, but a deployment altered our plans so we ended up postponing the wedding for a few years. \u00a0I ended up gaining wait and no longer fit into this dress, otherwise I would have been thrilled to wear it. \u00a0Pictures don't do it justice. \u00a0It is white with silver appliqu\u00e9 and beading. \u00a0Very simple A-line strapless dress with the petty coat to go underneath. \u00a0I paid over $700 and I am selling this for $399 OBO. \u00a0This really is a gorgeous dress and I wish I was able to wear it. \u00a0<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-33188200-1437676425.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3052.JPG - Size: 50.56KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-33188200-1437676425.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_3052.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-69361900-1437676429.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3054.JPG - Size: 59.42KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-69361900-1437676429.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_3054.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-40030900-1437676433.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3056.JPG - Size: 51.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-40030900-1437676433.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_3056.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-60518500-1437676437.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3059.JPG - Size: 53.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-60518500-1437676437.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_3059.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-77266700-1437676441.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3061.JPG - Size: 53.84KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-77266700-1437676441.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_3061.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901040]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-06023200-1437676445.jpg\" title=\"IMG_3062.JPG - Size: 51.25KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-284043-0-06023200